.TH PTYTEST 1 "June 12, 2026"
.UC 4
.SH NAME
ptytest \- smoke-test a pseudo terminal pair
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ptytest
[
.I unit
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ptytest
opens
.I /dev/ptypN
and
.I /dev/ttypN
for the selected unit, places the slave in raw mode, and verifies data transfer
in both directions.
.PP
The default unit is 0.
.SH FILES
.TP 12
.I /dev/ptypN
pseudo terminal master
.TP 12
.I /dev/ttypN
pseudo terminal slave
